-- Idle spawns that walk a waypoint path in LoA's or pandaria's world DB get that path (B19, follow-up to B18 / D22 / D36):
-- 388 spawns of 115 creatures (329 critters), 3117 waypoints. 46307 other idle spawns wander like the same creature nearby there
-- (or, with none nearby, like most of that creature's spawns); see the rules in the generator. Path pairing: same creature within 5 yd (15 yd for critters) of the patroller's spawn point or a
-- point of its path, best pairs first, patrollers already walked by one of our spawns skipped. Path id = guid * 10.
-- Script actions at points are not imported. Guards as in B18; creatures whose SmartAI starts a path are left alone.
-- Only touches spawns that are still MovementType 0 / spawndist 0 and still the same creature.
-- Generated by skyfire_port_plan/tools/dbcompare/b19_spawn_paths.py. Safe to run twice.

